a lot about her virginity.

00:03:02.040 --> 00:03:04.537
- There is rule in the book,
the Bible, that says that.

00:03:04.537 --> 00:03:07.500
I think that is a really
important thing to do.

00:03:07.500 --> 00:03:09.660
